abstract: >-
  Source-preserving transformation of HUG regional presale guarantee issuance statistics.
  Includes 818 rows, yearly and quarterly summaries, and source quality flags.
  Original source: Korea Housing & Urban Guarantee Corporation (HUG),
  https://www.data.go.kr/data/15002513/fileData.do.
  Guarantee issuance values are not apartment transaction or sale prices.
